#: org.kde.artikulate.appdata.xml:6
msgid "Artikulate"
msgstr "Artikulate"

#. (itstool) path: component/summary
#: org.kde.artikulate.appdata.xml:7
msgid "Artikulate Pronunciation Trainer"
msgstr "Entrenador de pronuncianción d'Artikulate"

#. (itstool) path: description/p
#: org.kde.artikulate.appdata.xml:9
msgid ""
"Artikulate is a pronunciation trainer that helps improving and perfecting a "
"learner's pronunciation skills for a foreign language. It provides courses "
"with native speaker recordings for several training languages. The learner "
"downloads those courses, selects a category of phrases to train, then starts "
"with recording her/his own voice when speaking the phrases and comparing the "
"results to the native speaker's recordings by listening to both. By "
"adjusting and repeating the own pronunciation, the learner can improve his/"
"her skill."
msgstr ""
"Artikulate ye un entrenador de pronunciación qu'ayuda a amaeyorar y "
"perfeicionar les habilidaes de pronunciación a un aprendiz d'una llingua "
"foriata. Apurre cursos con grabaciones de falantes nativos pa delles "
"llingües d'entrenamientu. L'aprendiz baxa esos cursos, esbilla un estaya de "
"frases pa entrenar, dempués entama cola grabación de la so propia voz al "
"dicir les frases y comparar los resultaos coles grabaciones del falante "
"nativu escuchando dambes. Axustando y repitiendo la pronunciación propia, "
"l'aprendiz pue ameyorar la so habilidá."
